        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur business is you.. \r\n\r\n6 Bedroom 7 Bathroom Semi Detached Family Home \r\nLaundry room / storage room \r\nExtended Family Home \r\nEarly Viewing is advised \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 134 Cabra Road to the Dublin 7 property market.\r\nNestled along the ever-popular Cabra Road, Sycamore House is an extended semi-detached residence that has been upgraded to provide spacious, versatile accommodation finished to an excellent standard. Boasting six generous bedrooms, seven bathrooms, an impressive rear extension and a converted attic, this outstanding home is ideal for growing families, multi-generational living or those seeking substantial living space in one of Dublin 7's most desirable residential locations.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the attractive red-brick façade creates an immediate sense of kerb appeal, while the private driveway provides ample off-street parking. Stepping through the entrance porch, you are welcomed into a bright and spacious entrance hallway that sets the tone for the generous accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nTo the left of the hallway is a double bedroom complete with its own ensuite bathroom, making it an ideal guest suite or accommodation for extended family. To the right, the front living room is bathed in natural light from a beautiful bay window, while high ceilings and a feature fireplace create a warm and inviting atmosphere. French doors open seamlessly into the formal dining room, another impressive reception space featuring high ceilings, a second feature fireplace and access back to the main hallway. There is also a downstairs wc \r\n\r\nBeyond the dining room is an exceptionally versatile room currently used as a spacious double bedroom with its own ensuite bathroom. With direct access to the rear garden, this flexible space could equally serve as a family room, home office, playroom or guest suite, adapting effortlessly to the needs of its new owners.\r\n\r\nThe impressive rear extension has been designed with modern family living in mind. Large Velux roof windows flood the space with natural light, creating a bright and airy atmosphere throughout. At the heart of the home is the superb open-plan kitchen and dining area, overlooking the rear garden through impressive floor-to-ceiling sliding doors. The contemporary fitted kitchen offers an abundance of floor and eye-level cabinetry, quality stone worktops and a practical breakfast island, making it an ideal space for everyday living as well as entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property continues to impress with 3 generously proportioned double bedrooms, each benefiting from fitted wardrobes and two with own private ensuite bathroom, providing exceptional comfort and privacy for every member of the household. A beautifully appointed family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe converted attic further enhances the flexibility of the home and features a Velux window together with its own ensuite bathroom. Currently used as an additional bedroom, this versatile space could equally serve as a home office, hobby room or additional storage, depending on the purchaser's individual requirements.\r\n\r\nOutside, the rear garden provides an excellent space for relaxing and entertaining. A substantial steel-framed garden shed, currently utilised as a home gym, offers excellent versatility, while additional outdoor storage further enhances the practicality of the property.\r\n\r\nCabra Road is one of Dublin 7's most established and sought-after residential addresses, offering an exceptional balance of convenience, connectivity and community. Situated approximately 3km from Dublin City Centre, the property is ideally positioned for commuters while providing easy access to all the amenities the capital has to offer. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes operating along Cabra Road, while both the Cabra and Broombridge Luas stops are within easy reach, providing fast and efficient access to the city centre and beyond. Broombridge Station also offers Irish Rail commuter services.\r\n\r\nFamilies are well catered for with an excellent selection of both primary and secondary schools nearby, including St. Vincent's Primary School, Gaelscoil Bharra, Christ the King National School, Coláiste Mhuire and St. Declan's College. The property is also within easy reach of Technological University Dublin's Grangegorman campus and Dublin City University. Residents enjoy a wealth of local amenities including cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, pharmacies, sports clubs and leisure facilities, while the nearby Phoenix Park, one of Europe's largest enclosed public parks, offers extensive walking and cycling trails, sporting facilities, Dublin Zoo and Áras an Uachtaráin. Excellent access to the M50 motorway, Dublin Airport and the wider national road network further enhances the convenience of this superb location.\r\n\r\nSycamore House presents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial  family home offering exceptional accommodation, remarkable flexibility and an unbeatable location in the heart of Dublin 7. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this outstanding home has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
